@Andronius
To install them, you simply need to add the character sheets to your game's files - go to "img" and "characters" and save them there. The sheets with only one character (eg. the individual pomeranian) needs to be saved with a $ at the beginning of the name (ex. $pomeranian.png). The sheets with 8 full characters don't need the $ (ex. pomeranians.png).
As for animating them, that is some really basic stuff of using MV. When you make the event, there are different ways to make them move, but most commonly by changing the Autonomous Movement settings. I strongly recommend you check out some tutorials to better understand how the program works. Also, next time, it's best if you start a new topic for this sort of help question.

